# Parity item #1 positive control, launch-card-v2 always-show shape: a NEWER foreign save
# interrupts the launch via the wizard's launch card (shown every launch since 2026-07-11),
# not a hook-drawn minui-list. Restore/decline live INSIDE the card (engine tests + knulli
# launchcard-check cover them); the hook only proves the handoff.
desc fetch hook: newer foreign save -> launch card handoff (card always shows)
invoke prehook
config paired
romarg Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
sdfile+ Roms/Game Boy Advance (GBA)/✓ Zelda.gba
engine 0|202\t2026-07-02 08:00\tFlip\t33KB\n101\t2026-07-01 10:00\tBrick\t32KB\tCURRENT\nLOCAL=older
wizard 0|LAUNCHCARD mode=summoned shown=1 action=play evicted=0
expect_exit 0
expect_trace WIZARD --launch-card --summoned
expect_trace ✓ Zelda.gba => rc=0
expect_trace_absent LIST[
expect_log listed=2 local=older action=card
